@hostname = http://localhost:3000

GET {{hostname}}/products

### Search for a product

GET {{hostname}}/products?q=mascara

### Filter products by category

GET {{hostname}}/products?category=beauty

### Sort products by price descending as ascending is default

GET {{hostname}}/products?sort=desc

### Paginate (page 2, two per page)

GET {{hostname}}/products?category=beauty&page=2&limit=2

### Get suggestions for a product

GET http://localhost:3000/products/suggest?q=mas&limit=8